WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.624
The Gaussian moat problem.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.156
Gaussian primes, joined when close. Can you

3
00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:07.175
walk to infinity with bounded steps?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.710
A long walk would need more residue

5
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.348
patterns than a few primes allow.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.603
Claimed: no, every such walk stays trapped.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.032
Lean: main theorem.
